{"id":"22E","title":"Reasons and Causes of War","part":{"n":22,"title":"Warfare and military laws"},"url":"/law/22-warfare-and-military-laws/22e","entries":[{"id":"22E.1","text":"War and defeat may be brought by God as punishment for national sins.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":28,"verses":"25,49-53"},{"book":"Joshua","chapter":7,"verses":"5-12"},{"book":"2 Samuel","chapter":12,"verses":"9-10"},{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":6,"verses":"24,36"},{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":12,"verses":"1-5"},{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":24,"verses":"23-24"},{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":28,"verses":"1-5"},{"book":"Job","chapter":19,"verses":"29"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":42,"verses":"13,16"},{"book":"Ezekiel","chapter":25,"verses":"12-13"},{"book":"Ezekiel","chapter":35,"verses":"4-9"},{"book":"Amos","chapter":1,"verses":"13-15"}],"citation":"Deut. 28:25, 49-53; Josh. 7:5-12; 2 Sam. 12:9-10; 2 Chron. 6:24, 36; 2 Chron. 12:1- 5; 2 Chron. 24:23-24; 2 Chron. 28:1-5; Job 19:29; Jer. 42:13, 16; Ezek. 25:12- 13; Ezek. 35:4-9; Amos 1:13-15."},{"id":"22E.2","text":"War may be of God or commanded by God.","refs":[{"book":"Numbers","chapter":25,"verses":"16-18"},{"book":"Numbers","chapter":31,"verses":""},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":2,"verses":"24"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":7,"verses":"1-2"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":20,"verses":"16-17"},{"book":"Joshua","chapter":8,"verses":"1"},{"book":"1 Samuel","chapter":15,"verses":"2-3"},{"book":"1 Chronicles","chapter":5,"verses":"22"},{"book":"Job","chapter":38,"verses":"23"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":51,"verses":"20"}],"citation":"Num. 25:16-18; Num. 31; Deut. 2:24; Deut. 7:1-2; Deut. 20:16-17; Josh. 8:1; 1 Sam. 15:2-3; 1 Chron. 5:22; Job 38:23; Jer. 51:20."},{"id":"22E.3","text":"Lust brings wars and fighting.","refs":[{"book":"James","chapter":4,"verses":"1-2"}],"citation":"James 4:1-2."},{"id":"22E.4","text":"War as a defense from unprovoked attack.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":17,"verses":"8-16"},{"book":"1 Samuel","chapter":30,"verses":"1-18"},{"book":"2 Samuel","chapter":5,"verses":"17-25"},{"book":"2 Samuel","chapter":10,"verses":"1-9"},{"book":"2 Samuel","chapter":21,"verses":"15-22"}],"citation":"Exod. 17:8-16; 1 Sam. 30:1-18; 2 Sam. 5:17-25; 2 Sam. 10:1-9; 2 Sam. 21:15-22."},{"id":"22E.5","text":"Evil men who continually stir up war.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":140,"verses":"1-2"}],"citation":"Psa. 140:1-2."},{"id":"22E.6","text":"War is not to be undertaken but by the will of God.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":1,"verses":"41"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":2,"verses":"5,9,19"},{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":11,"verses":"3-4"}],"citation":"Deut. 1:41; Deut. 2:5, 9, 19; 2 Chron. 11:3-4."},{"id":"22E.7","text":"He that kills with the sword must be killed with the sword.","refs":[{"book":"Matthew","chapter":26,"verses":"52"},{"book":"Revelation","chapter":13,"verses":"10"}],"citation":"Matt. 26:52; Rev. 13:10."}]}